- Added `inputChars` and `inputBreakdown` to `StepFinishPart` schema for detailed tracking of request body character counts.
- Implemented `charsPerTokenFromHistory` to calculate a session-specific chars-per-token ratio based on historical input data.
- Updated `computeFinalTokens` to utilize the new ratio for more accurate token estimates, especially for JSON-heavy content.
- Modified various utility functions and tests to support the new estimation logic, ensuring backward compatibility with existing functionality.
- Enhanced context usage calculations to leverage daemon-provided breakdowns for improved accuracy in per-category token estimation.

